I like your main idea, but I think having the
teleports go _off level_ is a bit over the top for
your middle game PC: that "losing critical
possessions" looks too much like a guaranteed way to
die to the typical monster levels that PC would be
encountering.

Having gear go off level might be nice as an
ultimate annoyance for a high level PC, especially,
of course, if it is an invocation artifact or the
Amulet of Yendor that goes sailing off into search
space, but then a high level PC should probably be
able to one-hit the master quantum mechanic, too.

